      },
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "say",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "真漂亮啊，好久没见到纯度这么高的结晶了",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "你是来找猫的对吧，这个能给我吗",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": ".....可能不太行，我已经和人约好了",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/guarded"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "真的不行吗 ^ ^",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "嗯，不行",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/guarded"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "好吧，真是可惜啊",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "fade",
          "to": "black",
          "time": 0.2
        },
        {
          "do": "image",
          "path": "res://art/cg/ch2_betrayal_01.jpg",
          "fade": 0.2,
          "fill": true,
          "wait_click": false,
          "hide": false
        },
        {
          "do": "say",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "可是，可",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "我已经给过你机会了，是你自己没有把握",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "不过还是得谢谢你，这种纯度的确实少见",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "你要怪就怪你的能力吧，让你拿着夜幕之泪去当敲门砖，倒不如就在这拜拜啦 ^ ^",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "play_sound",
          "path": "res://audio/sfx/footstep_wood.ogg"
        },
        {
          "do": "npc_move",
          "id": "c",
          "to": [
            233,
            -30
          ],
