        {
          "do": "say",
          "text": "回溯已经触发，冷却时间24h。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "rewind_resume_dialogue"
    },
    {
      "id": "rewind_resume_dialogue",
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "say",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "大喘气。",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/thinking"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "啊、这是重来了",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/shocked"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "这个夜幕之泪到底是什么.....竟然这么想得到它",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/thinking"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "这就不行了吗，你还是得多练呐",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "。。不用你管",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/guarded"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "C",
              "text": "？ 好吧",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "c/neutral"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "现在再来看，这调性也不像是白塔的人，也没有看见任何白塔的身份证明",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/thinking"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "想来是其他什么组织的",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/thinking"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "可恶，还是太大意了",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/guarded"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "也不像是我能打过的样子，要演戏是吧...",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/guarded"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "second_scene",
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "focus"
        },
        {
          "do": "say",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "是你...怎么又回来了？",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "！你竟然能记得之前的事",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/shocked"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "主人说过她会回来看我的，所以只要明天不到来，今天就永远是昨天",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "现在喵回来了，我又怎么会忘记任何",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "好啦好啦，本喵是这个蚀界的核心，喵当然知道这个时间锚里发生的所有事情",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "等你们带着结晶出去，没有能量维系，这里自然喵会消散",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "而你，你的能力是回溯吧喵，你的血液里带着时间的种子",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "你看那里的血迹，你既处于现在的喵，也处于过去的喵",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "因果可以说都凝聚在你身上，知道自己其实是个天赋怪吗喵喵",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "。。。？",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/puzzled"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "说人话谢谢",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/puzzled"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "本喵怎么会说人话呢嘻嘻",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "算了，我和你说那么多干什么",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "等...等一下，这个夜幕之泪到底是什么",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/thinking"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "为什么....就因为一个结晶就能杀了我！",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/guarded"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "蚀界产生的结晶内含有巨大的能量，这个C是告诉过你了喵",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "但他没告诉你喵，达到一定品质的结晶会带有特殊的能力",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "品质越高，其相对能力喵也越强",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "而且喵，能力者的天赋，决定了ta在蚀界内获得结晶品质的上限",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "那么现在你再看看你，其实你自己就是个宝贝啊喵喵喵",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "什.....什么",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/shocked"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "那其实我投靠C的话，这一切都解决了......",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/thinking"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "不行，能随便杀人的组织能是什么好组织",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/guarded"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "猫",
              "text": "这就要你自己决定了喵，你该走了，你在这待的时间太长了喵",
              "side": "right",
              "portrait": "res://art/props/library_cat_cover.png"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "text": "好，回家，对，只要回去，白塔一定不会不管的",
              "side": "left",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": "second_cat_disappear"
    },
